@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava dermatologa
# @name derm
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "dermatolog@dermawise.rs", "password": "derm123"}

### Redovi template-a MaxConcentrationByPhototype (5 redova iz predloga)
GET {{host}}/api/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}

### DRL koji ObjectDataCompiler generiše iz redova (pravila "Provera bezbedne koncentracije N")
GET {{host}}/api/templates/generated-drl
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}

### Prijava korisnice Ana
# @name ana
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Pre izmene: adapalen 0.1% uveče
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}

### Dermatolog dodaje red: adapalen za fototip I-III najviše 0.05%, baze znanja se ponovo grade bez restartovanja
# @name addRow
POST {{host}}/api/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sastojak": "adapalen", "minFototip": 1, "maxFototip": 3, "maxKoncentracija": 0.05, "napomena": "niža koncentracija na početku terapije"}

### Posle izmene: adapalen 0.05% sa upozorenjem iz reda i napomenom u safetyNotes
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}

### Neispravan red (pokušaj ubacivanja DRL-a kroz napomenu) se odbija sa 400, pravila ostaju ista
POST {{host}}/api/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sastojak": "retinol", "minFototip": 1, "maxFototip": 6, "maxKoncentracija": 1, "napomena": "\"); retract($u); //"}

### Brisanje dodatog reda i ponovni rebuild
DELETE {{host}}/api/templates/{{addRow.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}

### Ponovo adapalen 0.1%
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
